  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for StrictId: OpenAPI schema generation with per-type\n            patterns and examples, route constraints, legacy TypeConverter support, and\n            ProblemDetails mapping for parse-failure binding errors. Route binding is free\n            via ISpanParsable<T> in .NET 7+; this package adds the polish.",
  "id": "StrictId.AspNetCore",
  "isPrerelease": true,
  "lastEdited": "2026-04-06T14:09:48.027Z",
  "licenseExpression": "MIT",
  "licenseUrl": "https://licenses.nuget.org/MIT",
