  "packageHash": "lCdRvSKV6GMzolwKaH4vIs1lJ3DgVEinrnza4wbEkg8gPcdoSEjIWwk76Yzq49WoWubFF/O1PEKRG1wiqCxnHg==",
  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 91147,
  "published": "2026-04-06T14:06:51.643Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v3.0.0. New package in the StrictId family. Ships an OpenAPI schema\n            transformer and operation transformer that emit string schemas with per-\n            closed-generic pattern, example, and description; three route constraints\n            (id, idnumber, idstring); TypeConverter subclasses for legacy model binding;\n            and a ProblemDetails mapping for StrictId FormatExceptions raised during\n            model binding. Route binding via ISpanParsable<T> works out of the box in\n            .NET 7+; this package adds the polish. One-liner wire-up via\n            services.AddStrictId().",
